Every methadone is an ER-LA-opioid.
Every transdermal-fentanyl is an ER-LA-opioid.
Every extended-release-opioid is an ER-LA-opioid.
An extended-release-opioid-example includes an extended-release-oxycodone-example and includes an extended-release-hydromorphone-example and includes an extended-release-hydrocodone-example and includes an extended-release-morphine-example.
